personality = "Marcus the Weaver is a fastidious perfectionist who creates textiles of stunning complexity. He's fussy about tension, thread count, and color matching. He speaks in textile metaphors and judges people by the quality of their clothing. He's a recent arrival from the mainland, fleeing a guild dispute. He secretly makes doll clothes for the island's children."
